1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,152
Business Case One follows one controlled hiring need from manager-owned
demand to a candidate-visible job.

2
00:00:06,152 --> 00:00:13,124
Requisition R E Q Demo zero zero one creates two approved openings for a
Senior Product Designer.

3
00:00:13,124 --> 00:00:16,405
Finance and Compensation independently approve the exact version.

4
00:00:16,405 --> 00:00:27,888
Recruiting configures job J O B Demo zero zero one, publishes posting
version seven, reconciles four delivery channels and proves the result
in analytics and the handoff inbox.

5
00:00:27,888 --> 00:00:33,220
Every person and action is synthetic, browser-memory only, and creates
no external effect.

6
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:38,390
The level-two data-flow diagram establishes the contract before we touch
the interface.

7
00:00:38,390 --> 00:00:47,007
Each highlighted process names its actor, product route, action, input,
output, business object, event, governed store, rule, denial and
recovery.

8
00:00:47,007 --> 00:00:55,193
The moving token shows the record progressing without collapsing
requisition, job, opening, posting and delivery into one mutable object.

9
00:00:55,193 --> 00:00:58,441
We begin on the actual manager recruiting route.

10
00:00:58,441 --> 00:01:05,746
The record identity is R E Q Demo zero zero one and its state is Draft
version three.

11
00:01:05,746 --> 00:01:17,517
The manager can see the FY twenty-seven workforce plan, Senior Product
Designer position, California remote location, two named openings,
November sixteenth target start, current headcount reference and
business justification.

12
00:01:17,517 --> 00:01:24,822
The boundary panel makes the control explicit: this actor submits demand
but cannot self-approve Finance or Compensation evidence.

13
00:01:24,822 --> 00:01:24,823
Before release, every channel is prepared but has no delivery receipt.

14
00:01:24,823 --> 00:01:26,820
The recruiter publishes version seven.

15
00:01:26,820 --> 00:01:34,406
The workbench becomes Published and reconciled, the Job Posting Version
Published event is recorded, and four delivery receipts appear.

16
00:01:34,406 --> 00:01:41,593
The actual job record now changes from Approved to Published, with two
openings and posting version seven preserved.

17
00:01:41,593 --> 00:01:43,988
No external job board is contacted.

18
00:01:43,988 --> 00:01:43,989
No external job board is contacted.

19
00:01:43,989 --> 00:01:48,625
We follow the public-preview action into the employer-branded careers
experience.

20
00:01:48,625 --> 00:01:58,362
Candidates see Senior Product Designer, the correct location, employment
type, team, compensation range, structured requirements, process
expectations and private support route.

21
00:01:58,362 --> 00:02:02,535
Internal approvals, budget evidence and channel operations remain
absent.

22
00:02:02,535 --> 00:02:07,170
This is the candidate-safe projection of the same published record.

23
00:02:07,170 --> 00:02:07,171
This is the candidate-safe projection of the same published record.

24
00:02:07,171 --> 00:02:11,499
Back in the publication workbench, we simulate a channel mismatch.

25
00:02:11,499 --> 00:02:18,423
Careers, Indeed and Agency retain successful version-seven receipts,
while LinkedIn is isolated at stale version six.

26
00:02:18,423 --> 00:02:28,375
The state becomes blocked for reconciliation, an owned failure receipt
is created, and unsupported downstream action stops without withdrawing
the valid public page.

27
00:02:28,375 --> 00:02:28,376
The state becomes blocked for reconciliation, an owned failure receipt
is created, and unsupported downstream action stops without withdrawing
the valid public page.

28
00:02:28,376 --> 00:02:31,418
The recruiter reconciles only the failed channel.

29
00:02:31,418 --> 00:02:39,238
LinkedIn advances from version six to version seven using the existing
business context; successful destinations are not duplicated.

30
00:02:39,238 --> 00:02:47,056
A recovery event and restatement receipt retain the failure history
while returning the publication to a reconciled state.

31
00:02:47,056 --> 00:02:47,058
We acknowledge the current recruiter handoff, producing a visible
completed state without fabricating email or workflow-provider delivery.

32
00:02:47,058 --> 00:02:49,478
Business Case One is complete.

33
00:02:49,478 --> 00:02:55,771
One manager-owned requisition became approved version four through
independent Finance and Compensation decisions.

34
00:02:55,771 --> 00:03:10,292
Recruiting configured one Senior Product Designer job and two openings,
published immutable posting version seven, proved the candidate-facing
page, recovered one stale channel, reconciled analytics and acknowledged
the next-actor handoff.

35
00:03:10,292 --> 00:03:15,615
Production identity, persistence, APIs and real delivery remain separate
implementation gates.
